@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-local-test-token

### Latest authoritative snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/energy
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Use stateVersion from GET; retain requestId when retrying this operation
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/energy/exchange
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"local-energy-exchange-1","stateVersion":1}
